# .gitignore

# Rapid SCADA compiled databases
**/BaseDAT/*.dat

# Docker build artifacts
docker/scada-bin/

# Runtime archives (generated data)
**/Archive/Min/
**/Archive/Hour/
**/Archive/Day/
**/Archive/Events/
**/Archive/Cur/

# Logs
**/ScadaServerWkr/Log/
**/ScadaCommWkr/Log/
**/ScadaWeb/log/
**/*.log
**/*.log.bak

# Runtime storage and cache
**/ScadaWeb/storage/
**/ScadaWeb/temp/
**/ScadaServerApp/Storage/
**/ScadaCommApp/Storage/
**/ScadaServerApp/Temp/
**/ScadaCommApp/Temp/

# .NET build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
venv/
.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
